<item>
<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-15T11:48:50.767Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:48:50 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces launched air strikes on gold mining sites near the Sudan-Egypt border, killing dozens of miners, while the Rapid Support Forces used a paramilitary drone to strike near the Ethiopian frontier, adding civilian casualties in West Kordofan. In the Blue Nile, the Sudanese army repelled a joint RSF and SPLM-N attack, inflicting heavy losses on the attackers. Drought, war and climate-related drone attacks are worsening the humanitarian crisis and raising the risk of famine across Darfur, Kordofan and other regions. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/africa/egypt-sudan-goldmine-strike.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168577&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQU2VONDlQSmpCSUpDeFlBb1FkTnM4OXlDeG5KekdUcVptQWtJT2kxaVhHaTl3WVY4U1J5YXphejJhODk1NWxaZEYzcDd6NHVyTmg2UUxYa1BjNmltM0pKTG9BU0Ezd2NqRm9GcFdGOHJROGhXdmFVVUdzNlJ5ck9veVJHR0V1dF9uU3hyNnc1Q080a0psY3BicE5OeEQ5SHlRZnZhZ1lkQUoxeUlpRVZKQUZ0dWRMSEhh?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1kSGVDUUVRNkpSVlpUcDZWY3UwQXJrRl9ockVsTGdvZVVQS1VFS1hZcVFhRjZ6QnFVMDlJcFZtUm1XMV9FeGdmMHo5b1M1VkVpdllmV25UbU1iM1lLOUdCcUNKOUIxYmotbWg5ZXBOMk1xQnI4SnNmLU5B?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
